		"description": "<p>A simple ranged weapon, comprising a hard outer shell filled with a reactive payload, and an explosive charge to break the shell and set off the payload after a brief delay.</p><p>Blast bombs contain a more powerful explosive charge along with hardened metal and ceramic shrapnel which is hurled at high speed by the blast. Incendiary bombs ignite a flammable liquid and spread it over an area. Tangle bombs contain an adhesive chemical mixture that rapidly expands and hardens when the bomb detonates, entangling anyone nearby.</p>",
